  "inline_comments": [],
  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "First ping, CI green since day one. With --enable-mfu-metrics and the debug env var set, the server currently dies on the very first request: per-request records leak into a wire field typed dict[str, int] and the frontend's typed decoder rejects the whole EngineCoreOutputs. The fix filters the dict at the production site so the debug records stay engine-side. A maintainer look would be appreciated.\n",
      "created_at": "2026-10-12T21:10:06Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/58615#issuecomment-6132660935",
      "id": 6132660935,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-12T21:10:06Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "he-yufeng"
      }
    }
